DESCRIPTION >
    Customer/entity-level hourly counts for events where each property key is present. Property
    values are not stored, so UUID and per-event-unique values cannot increase this rollup's
    cardinality. Sibling of events_org_property_coverage_hourly_mv for customer- and entity-scoped
    property group-by queries, whose completeness check otherwise compares against every event in
    scope and treats events that lack the key as gate loss.

SCHEMA >
    `org_id` String,
    `env` String,
    `customer_id` String,
    `entity_id` String DEFAULT '',
    `event_name` String,
    `property_key` String,
    `hour` DateTime,
    `event_count` AggregateFunction(sum, UInt64)

ENGINE "AggregatingMergeTree"
ENGINE_PARTITION_KEY "toYYYYMM(hour)"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "org_id, env, property_key, customer_id, entity_id, event_name, hour"

BACKFILL skip
